  "vector_memory": {
    "semantic_summary": "PlanarQuadHelper is a low-level rendering utility responsible for managing and drawing a fixed L-shaped quad bracket geometry within the scene editor. It initializes by pre-calculating and uploading vertex and index data for the shape into dedicated WebGL buffers. The public draw method utilizes a provided Shader instance to render this geometry by binding the buffers and executing gl.drawElements, acting as a specialized geometry primitive manager."
  },
